                                "sense_id": "cd3cafc9-d997-3fd0-8490-b19672a7e895",
                                "text": "Cecil Spenser's society—who soon shewed he could understand and enter into his views—became a source of great gratification, and his young countryman was almost domesticated at the palazzo."
